[4.288, "o", "Conductor · import · registry conch-integrations\r\nregistry conch-integrations, version 1 · not checked (unsigned index)\r\n\r\nWhat it does in conch\r\n  ✓ Its conversations, brought into conch\r\n      Integrations → Import…, conch import NAME: each one written as a handoff an agent can read and carry on from\r\n  ✓ Its workspaces' repositories\r\n      Named beside each conversation, with the folder to carry it on in\r\n  ✗ Resume a conversation in its own agent\r\n      Not yet: an agent carries one on from its handoff\r\n\r\nConductor reads its own files on this machine; nothing is sent anywhere.\r\nFound on this machine: conch import conductor brings its conversations in.\r\n\r\nNote: Conductor's conversations and workspaces, from its own database on this Mac. Conductor Cloud workspaces must be moved to the Mac in Conductor first.\r\nDocs: https://www.conductor.build/docs\r\n"]
